From 311f3226b471460d5eed6b5d4dfa550540881dc8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Albert <albert@tugraz.at>
Date: Wed, 22 Apr 2026 14:04:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] testsuite: Add Fujitsu-CTS provenance headers [PR
 fortran/123949, PR fortran/124208]

Three committed gfortran testcases (pdt_85.f03, pr123949.f90, pr124208.f90)
derive from the Fujitsu Compiler Test Suite
(github.com/fujitsu/compiler-test-suite, Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception,
GPLv3-compatible) via David Binderman's minimised reducers attached to
Bugzilla Comment #0.  Because the upstream is external third-party
material, the chain of custody should be visible in the file itself
rather than only via the Bugzilla PR reference.

Each header names the specific Fujitsu source file cited in Comment #0
and credits the reducer.  No behavioural change; comment-only addition.

This is the only attribution addition from the 2026-04-22 provenance
audit that needed a code change: Bugzilla Comment #0 reducers written
by the reporter themselves are already adequately traced via the
PR number and need no retroactive in-file attribution.  External
third-party code (here, the Fujitsu CTS) is the case where the header
carries real information.

Audit tracker: meta-repo commit 40f0a94,
https://github.com/krystophny/gcc-dev/issues/162,
https://github.com/krystophny/gcc-dev/issues/163.

Assisted-by: Claude (Anthropic)
Assisted-by: GPT (OpenAI)

	PR fortran/123949
	PR fortran/124208

gcc/testsuite/ChangeLog:

	* gfortran.dg/pdt_85.f03: Add Fujitsu-CTS provenance header.
	* gfortran.dg/pr123949.f90: Add Fujitsu-CTS provenance header.
	* gfortran.dg/pr124208.f90: Add Fujitsu-CTS provenance header.

Signed-off-by: Christopher Albert <albert@tugraz.at>
---
 gcc/testsuite/gfortran.dg/pdt_85.f03   | 2 ++
 gcc/testsuite/gfortran.dg/pr123949.f90 | 2 ++
 gcc/testsuite/gfortran.dg/pr124208.f90 | 2 ++
 3 files changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/gcc/testsuite/gfortran.dg/pdt_85.f03 b/gcc/testsuite/gfortran.dg/pdt_85.f03
index e22d18be981..8f7b5c36251 100644
--- a/gcc/testsuite/gfortran.dg/pdt_85.f03
+++ b/gcc/testsuite/gfortran.dg/pdt_85.f03
@@ -1,4 +1,6 @@
